2439..2514 Comment "/// Put-get, put-put and get-get together, the laws a state-passing handler"
2515..2591 Comment "/// is checked against (`../specification/state-wp.gandr`). A read of a read"
2592..2670 Comment "/// under a store is a redex of put-get and of get-get, and both reducts store"
2671..2748 Comment "/// the value and continue at it twice. Get-put beside them is refused in the"
2749..2766 Comment "/// twin (#1934)."
